<Layout title="Privacy & Demo Notice | FIELDNOTE Property" description="Information about how the fictional seller valuation form handles data in demo mode." brand="FIELDNOTE / PROPERTY" nav={[{label:'Back to valuation',href:p+'#valuation'}]} accent="#244438"><section class="legal container"><p class="eyebrow">PRIVACY / DEMO</p><h1>Privacy notice.</h1><p>FIELDNOTE is a fictional real estate brand. Its valuation process does not provide valuations or represent a live operator.</p><h2>Submission and storage</h2><p>Without a configured HTTPS endpoint, the form validates on your device and does not transmit or retain your details on a server. A future operator needs to publish verified identity, processing purposes, legal basis, retention, recipients and rights procedures before collecting actual leads.</p><h2>Attribution</h2><p>URL campaign parameters may be kept in local browser session storage to demonstrate marketing attribution. Analytics integrations are disabled by default.</p><h2>Property figures</h2><p>Any example pricing or market commentary is purely illustrative and not a professional appraisal.</p><a href={p}>← Return to FIELDNOTE</a></section></Layout>
